 driver-side mirror.\nI immediately took my car to Shree Honda Kalikapur, an authorized Honda service center and body shop in Kolkata, to claim my insurance. Thankfully, I had a 1st party bumper-to-bumper insurance policy from ICICI Lombard.\nWatch this video to see the entire process of the insurance claim, the service I received at Shree Honda Kalikapur, and how hassle-free it was to get my Honda Amaze's side mirror replaced. I only had to pay a minimal processing fee of ₹1000!\nThis video highlights the importance of having good car insurance (like ICICI Lombard's bumper-to-bumper coverage) and the efficiency of authorized Honda service centers in Kolkata. If you own a Honda car in Kolkata or are considering buying one, this video might be helpful for you!\nHave you had any similar experiences with car accidents and insurance claims? Share your stories in the comments below! 👇\n👍 Like this video if you found it informative!\n➡️ Subscribe for more car-related content and personal experiences!\n#hondaamaze #honda #caraccident #insuranceclaim #icicilombard #bumpertobumperinsurance #shreehondakalikapur #hondaservice #hondacarsindia #hondacarskolkata #sodepur #dadaboudibiriyani #carrepair #automotive #carownership #indiancars #kolkata #westbengal #car #accidentstory\n\nDetails:\nHonda Amaze S MT 2020 Variant (Red):\nThis is the \"S\" mid-level trim of the first-generation (second iteration) Honda Amaze with a manual transmission (MT), manufactured in 2020, and in a red color.\n Engine: Likely powered by a 1.2L i-VTEC petrol engine (around 89 bhp and 110 Nm torque) The \"S\" variant in 2020 was available with both engine options.\n Key Features (S Variant - likely in 2020): Typically included features like dual front airbags, ABS with EBD, power steering, all four power windows, manual AC, a basic audio system, rear parking sensors, and body-colored bumpers and door mirrors. The \"S\" trim aimed to offer a balance of essential features at a competitive price point.\nRed Color: This is a popular and easily identifiable color for the Honda Amaze.\nShree Honda Kalikapur Service and Body Shop:\nThis is an authorized Honda service center and body shop located in Newtown, Ecospace, Kalikapur, Kolkata near DPS school.\n Authorized service centers are equipped with trained technicians, genuine Honda parts, and the necessary tools for servicing and repairing Honda vehicles according to the manufacturer's standards.\nBody shops at authorized service centers typically handle accident repairs, including panel beating, painting, and replacement of damaged parts.\n\nDespite the damage, you were unharmed, and the damage was limited to the side mirror.\n   \nHad a comprehensive \"1st Party\" or \"Bumper to Bumper\" car insurance policy from ICICI Lombard.\n1st Party Insurance: Covers damages to your own vehicle in case of an accident, theft, or other covered perils.\nBumper to Bumper Coverage: This is an add-on to a comprehensive policy that typically covers the entire cost of replacement of parts without depreciation (except for consumables), meaning you usually pay only the processing fee. With zero depreciation.\nThe fact that you only paid a ₹1000 processing fee for a mirror replacement indicates that your \"Bumper to Bumper\" coverage was effective.\n Honda has a network of authorized service centers across India, including Shree Honda Newtown, Ecospace, Kalikapur, Kolkata near DPS school.\n Honda service centers are expected to provide quality service using genuine Honda parts and adhering to Honda's service protocols.\nExperience at Shree Honda Newtown, Ecospace, Kalikapur, Kolkata near DPS school seems to have been positive, with a smooth insurance claim process and mirror replacement.\n Honda Cars India is the Indian subsidiary of the Japanese automobile manufacturer Honda.\n responsible for the manufacturing, marketing, and sales of Honda vehicles in India, as well as managing the after-sales service network.\n The Honda Amaze is one of their popular compact sedan models in the Indian market.\n This refers to the network of Honda car dealerships and service centers located within the Kolkata region, including Shree Honda Kalikapur.\nSodepur Dada Boudi Biriyani:\nThis is a very famous and well-regarded biriyani restaurant located in the Sodepur area of Kolkata.", "channel_id": "UCWGb_mEs7cvrh9EQ7rjCQFg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWGb_mEs7cvrh9EQ7rjCQFg", "duration": 215, "view_count": 51, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fT2JJ_tcORY", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 0, "location": "SHREE HONDA", "channel": "Prayas Bhattacharyya", "channel_follower_count": 1120, "uploader": "Prayas Bhattacharyya", "uploader_id": "@prayasbhattacharyya", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@prayasbhattacharyya", "upload_date": "20250411", "timestamp": 1744400202, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist_count": 281, "playlist": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-12-01 before:2025-06-01", "playlist_id": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-12-01 before:2025-06-01", "playlist_title": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-12-01 before:2025-06-01", "playlist_webpage_url": "ytsearch300:ICICI Lombard after:2024-12-01 before:2025-06-01", "n_entries": 281, "playlist_index": 197, "display_id": "fT2JJ_tcORY", "fulltitle": "Honda Amaze Accident & Repair Journey: ICICI Lombard Insurance Experience at Shree Honda Kolkata", "duration_string": "3:35", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1780232732, "comments": [], "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_cha